READ FIRST — WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

Dhee-Pravega-Atom-IT was trained from random initialisation by Dheeyantra
Research Labs. No third-party model weights were used, so no upstream model
terms apply. Dheeyantra's weights, configuration and tokenizer are licensed to
you for RESEARCH USE ONLY under this Licence.

The source files `modeling_dhee.py` and `dhee_chat.py` are code, not Model
weights. They remain under the Apache License 2.0, as listed in the NOTICE file,
and nothing in this Licence removes rights you have to them under Apache-2.0.

